# Stay in this core repo (hard)

`fynns_ui_design_core` is the **only** workspace root for the **parent** agent
in this chat.

## Forbidden

- Calling `move_agent_to_root` (or any equivalent) to switch into another repo
  (agents-hub, gsc-live-preview, music studio, corrector, thesis tools, …)
- Doing consumer installs / edits / browser verify by treating a sibling
  checkout as the active agent root
- Ending a core task “in” a consumer folder as the parent session

## Required instead

- Consumer work (bump `@fynn7/ui-design-core`, props-only fixes, paste
  `fynns-ui-consumer.mdc`, browser-verify on `localhost:5180`, …) →
  **dispatch a Task subagent** with an absolute path to that consumer.
  Parent stays here and waits for / summarizes the subagent.
- Subagents: Auto only (no `model` param) — see user rule.
- Core-first loop unchanged: constrain + sandbox + publish here, then
  subagent consumer verify (`/constrain-then-consumer`).

If a request seems to require leaving this repo as parent: refuse the root
move and spawn a subagent instead.
